Follow root `AGENTS.md`.

Skills: `.agents/skills/<name>/SKILL.md`; open only the one the task needs. A missing Cursor feature: work one step at a time (`HOST-CAPABILITY-FALLBACK.md` when it is installed). Subagents in `.cursor/agents/`: `designer` for real user-facing design work, `service-strategist` for business or service planning; not for simple tasks. If Cursor cannot run them, work one step at a time and say delegation was unavailable. Never claim usage metering without verified support.
